cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Flare Watch Nigeria: satellite estimates of gas flaring, 2012–2025"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
authors:
  - family-names: Badmus
    given-names: Malik Kolawole
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikbadmus79-max/flare-watch-nigeria"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A descriptive, reproducible monitor of gas flaring in Nigeria, 2012–2025, by flare site, field, operator
  (as recorded) and nearby population, built from World Bank GFMR satellite estimates, WorldPop and
  geoBoundaries, with a Power BI dashboard, an independent recompute and a full number and wording audit.
keywords:
  - gas flaring
  - Nigeria
  - satellite estimates
  - Power BI
  - World Bank GFMR
